# This repository holds code and documentation only. Everything the model
# produces (data, equations, catalogues, solved scenarios) is licensed content
# and stays on your machine. The patterns below are a safety net; the leak
# check in tools/check_confidential.py is the second one.

# ---- Credentials -------------------------------------------------------
# OE_TOKEN and the OE_AUTH_* settings come from the environment, never a file.
.env
.env.*
*.token
token.txt
*secret*
*credential*

# ---- Model content and output -------------------------------------------
# Default output and cache locations used by the toolkit.
outputs/
.oegem_cache/

# Scenario command files can carry baseline-derived levels; none are tracked.
*.3fs

# Data, catalogues, equations, manifests and reports in any format.
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.csv
*.parquet
*.pq
*.json
*.mat
*.tex
*.dot
*.html

# Charts and documents.
*.pdf
*.png
*.svg
*.pptx
*.docx
*.log

# ---- Python / MATLAB / editor cruft ------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
/build/
/dist/
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
venv/
*.asv
*.bak
.claude/
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
